  description="Side-by-side corrosion test data for 304 and 316 stainless steel wire mesh: salt spray hours, chloride limits, acid resistance, cost comparison, and a practical guide to choosing the right grade."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <nav class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-theme-primary">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2">›</span>
      <a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-theme-primary">Blog</a>
      <span class="mx-2">›</span>
      <span>304 vs 316 Stainless Steel Mesh</span>
