      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">3. Cost Comparison: Is 316 Worth the Premium?</h2>

      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Wire mesh pricing follows raw material cost plus weaving labor. Because 316 contains expensive molybdenum and more nickel, the base metal costs more before weaving begins. Current market pricing for standard plain-weave stainless mesh:
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-theme-card border-b border-theme">
